+---
+type: Specification
+title: Revision history
+description: How the Revisions screen groups, names and orders saved snapshots.
+---
+
+# Revision history
+
+Each post has one group headed by its current title. Each row keeps its title at
+publication. Within a group, newer snapshots appear first. If two snapshots
+share a second, the higher revision ID appears first. The [revisions query and
+grouping function](../sources/revision-order.txt) show both sort keys and how
+the screen preserves the incoming order within each post.
